  "question": {
    "text": "At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>298</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>, the solubility of silver chloride in water is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>434</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>logK</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub></math> for silver chloride is<br />(Given mass of Ag is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>107</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, and mass of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cl</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>35</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> )",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "10",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Formula unit mass of Silver chloride =&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>108</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>gmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>143</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>gmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />Solubility<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>434</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>143</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>AgCl</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>Ag</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>Cl</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>AgCl</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p>",
